{"id":"claro","lemma":"claro","pos":"adj","rank":102,"glosses":["light (pale in colour)","bright (luminous; not dark)","clear (without clouds nor fog)"],"ipa":"/ˈkla.ɾu/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/43/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Santamarcanda-claro.wav/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Santamarcanda-claro.wav.mp3","forms":{"feminine":"clara","masculinePlural":"claros","femininePlural":"claras"},"examples":[{"text":"Você devia falar mais claro.","en":"You should speak more clearly.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1270286","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"should","l":"dever"},{"g":"to speak"},{"g":"more"},null]},{"text":"Não está claro o bastante?","en":"Is it not clear enough?","words":[{"g":"not / no"},{"g":"is","l":"estar"},null,{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"enough"}]},{"text":"Eu só quero ser claro.","en":"I just want to be clear.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/535167","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"only"},{"g":"to want","l":"querer"},{"g":"to be"},null]},{"text":"É claro que a resposta é sim.","en":"Of course, the answer is yes.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/978252","words":[{"g":"is","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"the / to"},{"g":"answer, response"},{"g":"is","l":"ser"},{"g":"yes"}]},{"text":"Os incentivos estão claros.","en":"The incentives are clear.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"incentive","l":"incentivo"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null]}]}